ind":"announcement","title":"The Hundredth Floor: Extraction Joins Next Fest — Play the Updated Demo!","summary":"Go deeper—or get out with your loot?The Hundredth Floor: Extraction is taking part in Steam Next Fest! Our updated free demo is available now, featuring 25 floors, three bosses, and improved environment visuals.You’re a game tester trapped inside a broken virtual world. Your way home lies somewhere beneath a 100-floor abyss—and you’ll need to fight, loot, and build your way down.At extraction points, you can secure your haul and return to that floor on your next expedition. Or you can keep desce","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:59:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689522","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4172090-1844115010491827","game_id":"steam-4172090","kind":"announcement","title":"Optimization & Bug Fixes","summary":"Optimization:Players can now roll backward while locking onto a target.Equipped gear comparison is now displayed when selecting equipment in the backpack.Backpack items can now be interacted with via mouse drag and drop.Fixed an issue where some text overflowed the text box.Players can now switch between selectable interaction targets when interactable objects overlap.After an NPC dialogue ends, players can stand in place and interact again to trigger the conversation.Bug Fixes:Fixed an issue wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T12:08:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491827","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4172090-1841579228664038","game_id":"steam-4172090","kind":"announcement","title":"Live_Stream","summary":"Liv